; Room script 10: Pestilent Beast
;
; Op $96 turns some cells into free space (flag $80), so that parts of the cave that look solid can be walked through.
; .
; Room 10: column 0, row 2 of the 5x5 map (left is room 9, right 11, up 5, down 15, counted modulo 25). Unpacks sprite
; sets #R$6B46, #R$6BDA. Subscripts: #R$82F0, #R$7955, #R$7A2B. Items (#R$8EDF) at row,column: lever 4,7, doorway arch
; 17,23, heart 18,10, cross 4,26.
@label=RoomScript10
b$786B DEFB $97,$05         ; SPRITESET 5
 $786D DEFB $97,$06         ; SPRITESET 6
 $786F DEFB $87,$0A         ; ROOMNAME 10 "Pestilent Beast"
 $7871 DEFB $83 ; CALL ScriptRoomPanel
@isub=DEFW ScriptRoomPanel
 $7872 DEFW $82F0
 $7874 DEFB $83 ; CALL BlockCaveRock
@isub=DEFW BlockCaveRock
 $7875 DEFW $7955
 $7877 DEFB $99,$0A,$00,$00,$20,$01,$01,$00,$02,$15,$06,$02,$02,$04,$06,$06 ; TILEBLOCKS 10 rectangles
